# Strict ingest stores a typed-CRDT delta at the stamp it arrived with, so a
# later fold would have to upcast it.
MODULE: CrdtLiftedAtIngestKeepsStamp
TARGET: CrdtLiftedAtIngest
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a strictly ingested delta is not lifted to the receiver's target
PERTURBS: Deliver

--- FIND
                         /\ tag' = [tag EXCEPT ![e] = IF kind[e] = "Crdt" THEN tgt ELSE stamp[e]]
--- REPLACE
                         /\ tag' = [tag EXCEPT ![e] = stamp[e]]
--- END
